  "description": "The Kanzo Aluminium is an incredibly versatile bike. Mount fenders and you have an ideal, sturdy commuter for the most enjoyable ride to work you'll ever experience. Mount some off-road tires for some fun off the beaten path. The Kanzo A all-road bike features wide tire clearance and numerous lugs, making it great for bikepacking as well. Head out into nature and enjoy! This Kanzo will always support you. It has a very pleasant geometry that combines comfort and stability. This budget-friendly gravel bike has also completely nailed the sweet spot for riding gravel. Just take it off road to experience if for yourself! Want to make it your own? Visit our Ridley configurator to design this Kanzo A in your own style - to include color choice.",
